        <li><a href="https://www.spotlightpa.org/news/2026/11/pennsylvania-house-election-results-legislature-control-elections/" rel="noopener">Spotlight PA: Democrats flip PA Senate, giving Shapiro a powerful trifecta (November 3, 2026)</a></li>
