        <li><a href="https://votesolar.org/2027-is-the-year-a-vetted-plan-to-modernize-pennsylvanias-energy-system.htm" rel="noopener">Vote Solar: 2027 is the Year (October 22, 2026)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
